    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27746" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίωγ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pursuit, chase,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				139
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.34.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				10.6
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πώλων,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς διώκοντ ας πώλους</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				988
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ ἀετοῦ δ. φεύγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ξιφοκτόνον,</span> i. e. the
			sword, ib.<i><span class="en">
				354
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πλούτου δ.</span>
			<i>eager pursuit</i> of wealth, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				310b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>that which is chased,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				3.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a secret
			rite in the Thesmophoria, <i>from which men were driven away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
